<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria July producer prices hit 33 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria July producer prices hit 33 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's monthly producer price inflation hit an all-time high of 33 percent in July, the National Statistics Institute (NSI) figures show.</p>
<p> BULGARIAN PRODUCER PRICES   JULY    JUNE	JULY'95</p>
<p> monthly pct change	   +33.0   +18.9	 +0.1</p>
<p> cumulative since Jan 1	N.A.   +45.0	  N.A.</p>
<p>The rise in producer prices topped the monthly consumer price inflation of 23.3 percent in July, the highest since 1991, the NSI said.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
